o['formation']['explanation']='RawNode.Propose or serialized Node proposal handling reaches the current role. Followers forward to a known leader unless forwarding is disabled; candidates drop. The leader assigns current-term consecutive indexes, appends unstable entries, queues its own append response for persistence and broadcasts append messages anchored by previous index/term. A follower checks that anchor, appends only noncommitted conflicting suffix, bounds propagated commit to the matched extent and queues its reply through persistence. Term-filtered successful replies update peer Match. Active voter majority order statistics, or the minimum of both joint majorities, select a candidate index; leader commit advances only when that entry has its current nonzero term. Rejections, heartbeat-driven retries and snapshot fallback resynchronize lagging peers. Ready exposes committed entries only beyond the issued application frontier and blocks while a snapshot is outstanding; async delivery additionally requires locally stabilized entries. Caller application is reported by Advance or local apply response, advancing applied and freeing budget. Client proposal return is only admission/Step outcome and can precede or never lead to commitment.'
